      "skos:prefLabel": "Red teaming",
      "skos:definition": "A structured, adversarial testing practice in which people (and increasingly other models) deliberately try to make an AI system fail or behave harmfully, so that its flaws and vulnerabilities can be found, measured and mitigated before or after deployment.",
